{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25821","headline":"新楼诗二十首 · 李绅","name":"新楼诗二十首","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一峰凝黛当明镜，十仞乔松倚翠屏。\n秋月满时侵兔魄，素波摇处动龟形。\n旧深崖谷藏仙岛，新结楼台起佛扃。\n不学大蛟凭水怪，等闲雪雨害生灵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25821.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25821","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}